stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OPEN : Employee submits ticket
    
    OPEN --> IN_PROGRESS : Support assigns technician
    
    IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : Issue resolved with resolution note
    
    RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS : Employee reopens if issue persists
    
    RESOLVED --> CLOSED : Support or Admin marks closed
    
    CLOSED --> [*] : Ticket archived and immutable
